  expr_relational_err_record.pcpp - break step of expr_relational.pcpp:
  two records compared (SM0252)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\expr_relational_err_record.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\expr_relational_err_record.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
